# Unit05
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit05核心词汇

criterion/kraɪˈtɪriən/标准/What is the criterion for selecting candidates?
critical/ˈkrɪtɪkl/批评的；关键的/This is a critical moment in the negotiation.
criticism/ˈkrɪtɪsɪzəm/批评/He faced harsh criticism from the public.
crucial/ˈkruːʃl/关键的/This is a crucial decision for the company.
cultivate/ˈkʌltɪveɪt/培养/We should cultivate good habits from childhood.
currency/ˈkɜːrənsi/货币/The currency exchange rate fluctuates daily.
curriculum/kəˈrɪkjələm/课程体系/The school revised its curriculum this year.
decline/dɪˈklaɪn/下降；拒绝/The number of students declined this year.
decade/ˈdekeɪd/十年/Great changes have taken place in the past decade.
dedicate/ˈdedɪkeɪt/致力于/She dedicated her life to helping the poor.
defeat/dɪˈfiːt/击败/Our team defeated theirs in the final match.
defend/dɪˈfend/保卫/The lawyer defended his client in court.
deficit/ˈdefɪsɪt/赤字/The government is trying to reduce the budget deficit.
define/dɪˈfaɪn/定义/How do you define success?
deliberate/dɪˈlɪbərət/故意的/It was a deliberate attempt to mislead the public.
delicate/ˈdelɪkət/精致的/This is a delicate matter that requires careful handling.
deliver/dɪˈlɪvər/递送/The company delivers goods nationwide.
demand/dɪˈmænd/要求/There is a growing demand for organic food.
democracy/dɪˈmɑːkrəsi/民主/Democracy is based on the principle of equality.
demonstrate/ˈdemənstreɪt/证明/The experiment demonstrates the effectiveness of the method.
deny/dɪˈnaɪ/否认/He denied all the charges against him.
depict/dɪˈpɪkt/描绘/The painting depicts a beautiful landscape.
depress/dɪˈpres/使沮丧/The economic downturn depressed consumer spending.
deprive/dɪˈpraɪv/剥夺/War deprived many children of their childhood.
derive/dɪˈraɪv/来源于/The word is derived from Latin.
deserve/dɪˈzɜːrv/应得/She deserves recognition for her hard work.
design/dɪˈzaɪn/设计/The architect designed a modern building.
desire/dɪˈzaɪər/渴望/He has a strong desire to succeed.
desperate/ˈdespərət/绝望的/The situation was desperate but not hopeless.
destiny/ˈdestɪni/命运/She believed that destiny brought them together.
detect/dɪˈtekt/探测/The sensor can detect tiny changes in temperature.
determine/dɪˈtɜːrmɪn/决定/Hard work determines your success.
device/dɪˈvaɪs/设备/A smartphone is a multifunctional device.
devote/dɪˈvoʊt/致力于/She devoted all her energy to the project.
diagnose/ˈdaɪəɡnoʊz/诊断/The doctor diagnosed the illness quickly.
dimension/daɪˈmenʃn/维度/The problem has many different dimensions.
diminish/dɪˈmɪnɪʃ/减少/The importance of this issue should not be diminished.
discipline/ˈdɪsəplɪn/纪律；学科/Mathematics is a rigorous discipline.
disclose/dɪsˈkloʊz/披露/The company refused to disclose its financial data.
discount/ˈdɪskaʊnt/折扣/The store offers a 20% discount on all items.
discriminate/dɪˈskrɪmɪneɪt/歧视/It is illegal to discriminate against women.
dismiss/dɪˈsmɪs/解雇；驳回/The court dismissed the case.
display/dɪˈspleɪ/展示/The museum displays rare artifacts.
dispose/dɪˈspoʊz/处理/Please dispose of the waste properly.
dispute/dɪˈspjuːt/争端/The two countries are involved in a territorial dispute.
distinct/dɪˈstɪŋkt/不同的/There are two distinct approaches to this problem.
distinguish/dɪˈstɪŋɡwɪʃ/区分/It's hard to distinguish the twins.
distribute/dɪˈstrɪbjuːt/分配/The food was distributed to the victims.
disturb/dɪˈstɜːrb/打扰/Please don't disturb me while I'm working.
diverse/daɪˈvɜːrs/多样的/The city has a diverse cultural heritage.
